<title>CANADA: Cornucopia receives C$12 mln from warrants.</title>
<headline>Cornucopia receives C$12 mln from warrants.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cornucopia Resources Ltd said on Wednesday it received C$12.1 million from its offer of special warrants, which will be used to help fund construction of its Mineral Ridge Mine project.</p>
<p>&quot;It is anticipated that mine construction will be completed during the first quarter of 1997, with commercial production to follow shortly thereafter,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
